# wfe run bookkeeping. The scope node writes an intent record into the work
# item's checkout; it describes the run, not the product, so implement must not
# commit it into the branch it is building. Ignored so a slice PR carries only
# its engineering diff. See wfe_manager_artifacts.c (intent_self_referential).
.wfe-scope.json
intent_record_*.json
